---
import MockDesktop from '../components/MockDesktop.astro';
import MockComponents from '../components/MockComponents.astro';
import '../styles/editor.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Theme Creator · OpenStation</title><meta name="description" content="Create a desktop theme with live component previews."/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/studio/css/dashicons.css"/><link rel="icon" href="../assets/logomark-app-circle.svg"/></head>
<body>
	<a href="#preview" class="skip-link">Skip to live preview</a>
	<header class="studio-header">
		<a class="studio-brand" href="../" aria-label="Back to OpenStation landing"><img src="../assets/logomark-app-circle.svg" width="30" height="30" alt=""/><strong>OpenStation</strong><span>/</span>Theme Creator</a>
		<div class="document-name"><span class="save-dot"></span><input id="theme-name" aria-label="Theme name" value="Untitled theme" maxlength="120"/><span id="save-state">Saved locally</span></div>
		<div class="header-actions"><button id="undo" class="icon-button" aria-label="Undo" title="Undo (⌘/Ctrl Z)" disabled>↶</button><button id="redo" class="icon-button" aria-label="Redo" title="Redo (⌘/Ctrl Shift Z)" disabled>↷</button><span class="action-divider"></span><button id="reset-theme" class="quiet-button">Reset theme</button><button id="import-button" class="quiet-button">Import</button><input id="import-file" type="file" accept="application/json,.json,application/zip,.zip" hidden/><button id="export-button" class="export-button">Export theme <span>↗</span></button></div>
	</header>
	<main class="studio-layout">
		<aside class="editor-panel" aria-label="Theme controls">
			<div class="panel-heading"><h1>Theme Creator</h1></div>
			<div class="preset-section"><div class="section-label">Presets</div><div class="preset-grid"><button class="preset active" data-preset="brand" aria-pressed="true"><span class="preset-art brand-art"><i></i></span>Station</button><button class="preset" data-preset="light" aria-pressed="false"><span class="preset-art light-art"><i></i></span>Daylight</button><button class="preset" data-preset="ocean" aria-pressed="false"><span class="preset-art ocean-art"><i></i></span>After hours</button></div></div>
			<nav class="editor-modes" aria-label="Customization area"><button data-editor-mode="tokens" aria-pressed="true">Properties</button><button data-editor-mode="textures" aria-pressed="false">Textures</button><button data-editor-mode="icons" aria-pressed="false">Icons</button><button data-editor-mode="fonts" aria-pressed="false">Fonts</button><button data-editor-mode="wallpapers" aria-pressed="false">Wallpapers</button><button data-editor-mode="layout" aria-pressed="false">Layout & effects</button><button data-editor-mode="assets" aria-pressed="false">Assets</button></nav><div id="custom-controls" hidden></div><div class="token-navigation"><label class="search-field"><span>⌕</span><input id="token-search" type="search" placeholder="Find a color, surface, detail…" aria-label="Search tokens"/><kbd>/</kbd></label><div class="filter-row"><select id="token-group" aria-label="Token category"><option value="Essentials">Essentials</option></select><label class="modified-filter"><input id="modified-only" type="checkbox"/> Edited</label></div><div class="results-line"><span id="token-count"></span><button id="reset-all" class="text-button">Reset edits</button></div></div>
			<div id="token-list" class="token-list"></div>
		</aside>
		<section class="preview-workspace" aria-label="Live theme preview">
			<div class="preview-toolbar"><div class="preview-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Preview scene"><button data-scene="desktop" aria-pressed="true">▣ &nbsp; Desktop</button><button data-scene="components" aria-pressed="false">▦ &nbsp; Components</button><button data-scene="atlas" aria-pressed="false">◈ &nbsp; All surfaces</button></div><div class="preview-options"><button id="compare" aria-pressed="false" title="Compare with the original Station theme">◐ <span>Compare original</span></button><button id="preview-focus" aria-pressed="true" title="Preview the active or inactive window">◉ <span>Focused</span></button></div></div>
			<div class="canvas-label"><span>Click any surface to edit its properties</span><span id="override-count">0 / 512 overrides</span></div>
			<div id="preview" class="preview" tabindex="-1"><MockDesktop/><MockComponents/><div id="surface-atlas" class="surface-atlas" hidden></div><div id="asset-scene" class="asset-scene" hidden></div></div>
			<footer class="workspace-footer"><button id="about-tokens" class="text-button">Token reference ↗</button></footer>
		</section>
	</main>
	<div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
	<dialog id="reset-dialog" class="reset-dialog" aria-labelledby="reset-title" aria-describedby="reset-description reset-recovery">
		<div class="dialog-heading"><span class="reset-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↺</span><button type="button" data-close class="icon-button" aria-label="Close reset confirmation">×</button></div>
		<h2 id="reset-title">Reset this theme?</h2>
		<p id="reset-description"></p>
		<div class="reset-destination"><span class="preset-art brand-art" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span><div><strong>Back to Station</strong><span id="reset-scope"></span></div></div>
		<p id="reset-recovery" class="reset-recovery">Uploaded files stay in your library. You can undo this reset.</p>
		<div class="dialog-actions"><button type="button" id="reset-cancel" data-close class="quiet-button" autofocus>Keep editing</button><button type="button" id="reset-confirm" class="reset-confirm">Reset theme</button></div>
	</dialog>
	<dialog id="export-dialog"><form id="export-form"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><h2>Export theme</h2></div><button type="button" data-close class="icon-button" aria-label="Close export">×</button></div><p>Download an installable ZIP or keep a JSON copy to edit later.</p><label>Theme name<input id="export-name" required maxlength="120"/></label><div class="form-row"><label>Theme ID<input id="export-id" required pattern="[a-z0-9_\-]+(/[a-z0-9_\-]+)?" maxlength="64" placeholder="my-studio/my-theme"/></label><label>Version<input id="export-version" required maxlength="32" value="1.0.0"/></label></div><label>Author<input id="export-author" maxlength="120" placeholder="Your name or studio"/></label><label>Description<textarea id="export-description" rows="2" maxlength="500" placeholder="A few words about your theme"></textarea></label><div class="export-summary" id="export-summary"></div><p id="export-error" class="field-error" role="alert"></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button type="submit" name="format" value="json" class="quiet-button">Download JSON</button><button type="submit" name="format" value="zip" class="export-button">Download ZIP ↗</button></div></form></dialog>
	<dialog id="token-help-dialog" aria-labelledby="help-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Property</span><h2 id="help-title"></h2></div><button data-close class="icon-button" aria-label="Close token help">×</button></div><code id="help-token"></code><p id="help-description"></p><p id="help-state"></p><div class="help-tip"><strong>How to edit it</strong><p id="help-input"></p></div><details class="help-reference"><summary>Default &amp; source reference</summary><code id="help-default"></code><p id="help-inherits"></p><pre id="help-evidence"></pre><p>These references identify the code used to explain the token. The studio uses copied UI components and independent desktop-shell sketches.</p></details></dialog>
    <dialog id="reference-dialog"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2>Token reference</h2><button data-close class="icon-button" aria-label="Close token reference">×</button></div><p id="reference-summary"></p><p>Every control comes from a checked-in snapshot of Alcazaba’s styles and Legacy manifest. Component specimens use a local copy of the real UI kit. Desktop-shell sketches illustrate the surrounding workspace without running WordPress.</p><p>Desktop and Components show representative surfaces. The surface atlas groups related properties into shared previews and exposes every catalog property and state. The texture, icon, font, wallpaper and layout galleries preview the full manifest contract. These are inert specimens; app layout and registered third-party effects need a final check in their host.</p><p>Only your edits are exported. Unchanged values keep the plugin’s defaults and accent relationships. Alcazaba accepts up to 512 token overrides per theme.</p><p>ZIP import and export preserve the manifest, referenced artwork, fonts and license files. JSON contains the manifest only; missing files can be attached in Assets. All changes and uploaded files are saved on this device.</p><p id="token-source" class="source-reference"></p></dialog>
	<script is:inline src="../assets/studio/components.js"></script>
	<script>import '../lib/editor';</script>
</body>
</html>
